@startuml VMS_VehicleState
!theme plain
title Vehicle Management System - Vehicle State Diagram

[*] --> ACTIVE

ACTIVE --> MAINTENANCE: Schedule maintenance
MAINTENANCE --> ACTIVE: Maintenance complete
ACTIVE --> INACTIVE: Deactivate vehicle
ACTIVE --> RETIRED: Vehicle end of life
INACTIVE --> ACTIVE: Reactivate vehicle
RETIRED --> [*]

note right of ACTIVE
  Vehicle is available for trips
  and can be assigned to drivers
end note

note right of MAINTENANCE
  Vehicle is under service
  not available for trips
end note

note right of INACTIVE
  Vehicle is temporarily unavailable
  but can be reactivated
end note

note right of RETIRED
  Vehicle is permanently retired
  from service
end note

@enduml
